&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why BAYADA?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly pay with Direct Deposit available (including recent pay increases!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible scheduling to fit your lifestyle&lt;/li&gt;
